-- DYNAMIC LANE CHOREOGRAPHY — renders the server's laneState on the in-world
-- signs (client-local SurfaceGui writes) + a screen event strip. Count-up
-- ladders show EVERY integer (10..25 in ~0.45s), expiries rewind over the
-- exact grace window the server keeps paying, JACKPOT is a typed-in charged
-- state of the center triptych, and COSMIC OVERLOAD reveals through
-- milestones 25/50/100/250/500/1000. All state is server-authoritative:
-- this section only draws the LaneMutate events + PusherRemotes attributes.
